{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：22:07 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:07 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:07 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"「赤風驪」後上取勝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/f5d0c92cb715f4f75245967c8be126aa/2026-11/r6_5.jpg\"/><p>巴度可算是新一代快活谷殺手，這位法國騎師今季已經連贏五期谷草賽事，今晚第六場四班一六五○米策騎方嘉柏訓練的「赤風驪」後上取勝。</p><p>賽後方嘉柏說：「今仗步速很快，有利『赤風驪』後上，令馬兒交出強勁的後勁，今仗巴度走位一流，發揮出色，亦應記一功。」</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T14:24:02.302897+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":204,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T14:07:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T22:09:56.610239+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T14:17:25.089346+00:00","content_hash":"cd746b8edfd3541a8ebe3ff499b982b9f46c3a1a4f61415c451efe0ee410fa8a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}